From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:06:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 74/74] MIPS: configs: ad5x: Enable the PWM controller

For the speaker.
---
 arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig b/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
index 76d85fcb7..e0301ea6f 100644
--- a/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
@@ -72,6 +72,8 @@ CONFIG_DMA_JZ4780=y
 # CONFIG_INGENIC_TIMER is not set
 CONFIG_INGENIC_X2600_OST=y
 # CONFIG_IOMMU_SUPPORT is not set
+CONFIG_PWM=y
+CONFIG_PWM_INGENIC_X2600=y
 CONFIG_PHY_INGENIC_USB=y
 CONFIG_PHY_ROCKCHIP_INNO_DSIDPHY=y
 CONFIG_EXT4_FS=y
